{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_02_beg","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_02","title":"榮譽之人","storyCode":"IS-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1bcd4aec2716f8a45c070a98c6a6574830a0c8981676f685ff6c6061a8078b22","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾瓦多雷·德克薩斯。我該如何面對你？我該相信你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你是一個敘拉古人，他們說，你從骨子裡就浸透了暴力與野心。你和你的家族會徹底吞噬這裡......吞噬哥倫比亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你在我面前所表現出來的，是真正的你嗎？你看上去明明那麼優雅，那麼得體......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我也看見過你揮拳的樣子，指縫間流淌下鮮血，你的對手再也無法發出一聲詈罵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"哪一邊是真正的你，薩爾瓦多雷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會有一天，你最終意識到這兩者無法相容？會不會有一天，你身後的血跡終將追上你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"到那時，你會做何選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"到那時......你還會留在我的身邊嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漂亮的演出，空小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毫無疑問，你又一次給了我驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"這其實要感謝劇團裡一位叫做文的先生，如果不是他的指導，我也做不到馬上調整自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是沒有聽說過，在這座米蘭劇場裡，有這樣一位人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"他對歌舞劇十分瞭解，給了我很好的指導，我還以為是劇團的重要人物呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有印象。不過，對於歌舞劇有心得的人數不勝數，或許他也只是其中之一吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，空小姐，我有一個在見到你的履歷時就產生了的疑問，不知道你能不能為我解惑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"可以呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在龍門走的是偶像路線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們與龍門的合作在如今愈發頻繁，但雙方的演藝事業卻由於各自底蘊的不同而呈現出了一種競爭的狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這樣的前提下，塞壬唱片發給我的那些試鏡片段，卻證明你在歌舞劇方面並非毫無實力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這意味著你的野心並不局限於龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼讓你如此努力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......原因，有很多吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"但是最開始，我的想法其實也沒有很複雜，我只是希望，能夠追上一個人而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，就像這個劇本裡寫的一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"每當她偶爾看向天空，看向門外，看向空曠的街道時，她的眼神......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我覺得，她總有一天會離開我們，離開龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"“到那時，你會做何選擇？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，我們兩個能在敘拉古重逢，你不覺得是一種奇跡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在有事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巧了，我也有事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保護這個人是你的任務嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什麼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噫......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是不解風情，你說是吧，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們去保護目標，我來應付她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你要吃千層酥嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......給我一塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，這就對了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，不，在敘拉古，是不是叫你切利尼娜更合適？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，說實話，我也更習慣這麼叫你了，習慣的力量真可怕，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在龍門過著悠哉的生活，偶爾在羅德島碰個面，甚至還有可能一起出趟任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的劍都要生鏽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是這熟悉的雨，讓人能打起精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劍淋雨才會生鏽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，敘拉古的雨是用來沖刷血跡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你這樣，拿著劍招搖過市卻根本不打算用的人，才會擔心生鏽的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很簡單啊，因為你在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，德克薩斯，你有多久沒來敘拉古了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快十年了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"七年五個月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯家的天之驕子，已經有七年多沒有再踏上敘拉古的土地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得，你被你爺爺送回敘拉古作為質子，在薩盧佐家，你也住過一段時間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很短，但我們相處得很開心，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你管那叫“相處”的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身為一個哥倫比亞人，卻贏得了所有敘拉古家族的認可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，最後卻發生了那樣的事，真是令人痛心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，德克薩斯，這一次，你應該留下，多看一看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我辦完事就會回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼一說，一直以來我都很好奇啊，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你背叛了德克薩斯，主動成了離群的狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至拋棄了德克薩斯留在哥倫比亞的一切，為什麼在龍門卻依然以德克薩斯自居？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不關你的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有任何留在敘拉古的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會回龍門，有人在等我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以啊，我會幫你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要你的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你就打算這麼單打獨鬥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是在龍門找到了夥伴？在羅德島的經歷也沒有讓你學會依靠別人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古不是一個適合旅遊的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果羅德島打算在這裡建立分部，我也會勸他們再考慮一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你，唯獨你，我不能信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，你知道我姓什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，絕不會輕易下注的薩盧佐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不需要信任我，但你會需要薩盧佐的力量的，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你真的打算乖乖當貝洛內的寵物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“轟”的一聲，爆炸聲突如其來地在不遠處響起。火光輕易地就把那位名叫卡拉奇的部長捲入其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汽車炸彈？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？這麼古典？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡、卡拉奇部長！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":true,"text":"宴會場地受到襲擊，附近的家族成員立刻過來救援！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩邊同時發動襲擊嗎？真有意思呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是誰膽子那麼大呀，德克薩斯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......果然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"要回到龍門的話，應該怎麼做？\n從踏入這座城市開始，德克薩斯就一直在思考這個問題。\n按照與扎羅的約定，完全順從貝洛內的命令自然是最簡單的方法。\n但是，此時，德克薩斯已經隱隱感覺到——\n這座城市中正在發生的事情並不單純。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰派你們來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殺手","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不需要知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"但她並不擔心。\n她瞭解敘拉古，她知道這樣的事永無止境。\n她只覺得有些空虛，連她自己也沒有預料到的空虛，因為——\n不會有人在戰鬥中接應她。\n結束之後，也不會有人問她有沒有受傷，或者硬拉著她開派對。\n這對她來說，早已成了一種理所當然。\n以至於現在，僅僅離開龍門一小段時間，她就發現，龍門的一切竟是如此令人懷念。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你越是想要回去，越是想要斬斷聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只會越陷越深，越陷越深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好奇，等到你發現，自己已經滿身泥濘的時候，你會怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐，你又來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹布朗，你在啊，看來我運氣不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的車，我記得上周才洗過吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法，畢竟我的工作就是招人恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我會幫你洗乾淨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以去周圍逛逛，法官小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，我就在這裡等著就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐，我聽說，法官可是很吃香的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開豪車，上電視，市長都要禮讓幾分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，法官可是代表著西西里夫人的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像拉維妮婭小姐你這樣天天被人在汽車上潑油漆的法官，恐怕才比較少見吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起開豪車和上電視，我現在只想在你們店裡辦一張會員卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這種小店可沒有這麼高檔的服務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的氣色比之前好多了，那個家族沒有再找你的麻煩吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"托你的福，法官小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我昨天在大街上遇到他們，他們都避開了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒想過，在敘拉古還有像你這麼公正的法官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公正......他們只是在害怕我背後的人罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你就算有著貝洛內家的背景，卻依然處罰了依附於貝洛內家的家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里夫人在敘拉古，意味著公正，我不知道有多少代表她老人家意志的法官真的在做維護公正的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在我心裡，你就是公正的化身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不是什麼好話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我記得，你之前說你睡不著，有去看過醫生嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看過。醫生說，我沒有生理上的疾病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是精神狀態出了問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，你也有煩惱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......煩惱，說不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，對我來說，這份工作是一種消磨時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我不怎麼富有，但我也不怎麼需要錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道該做些什麼，法官小姐，我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐，你平時，都是怎麼消磨時間的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！卡拉奇部長被......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，我立刻過去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹布朗，抱歉，我們下次再聊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你剛才提到的問題——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的建議是，或許你可以去劇院試一試，我有空的時候，經常會去那裡觀看歌舞劇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"丹布朗走出店門。\n他目送這位自己十分尊敬的法官小姐駛入雨中，很快消失不見。\n“她總是這麼忙忙碌碌的。”丹布朗想著，在褲子上蹭乾了自己沾上水珠的手套。\n但她所做的一切，其實都沒什麼意義，不是嗎？\n不如說，正因為她仍抱有希望，所以才會一次又一次地失望。\n以前的日子可沒有這麼複雜。丹布朗看著店外的雨幕，突然回想起了許多年前的一個下午。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望雨下久一點，這樣，早上就不用掃垃圾了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趴下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噫——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......還以為只是個少爺，沒想到還挺難對付......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖，對方很難纏，盧比奧，退下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們明顯是衝著我來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我知道了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噫——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，那邊也有嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，難纏的傢伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，那不是企鵝物流的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趴下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噫，好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甘比諾，死了沒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我像是這麼容易死的嗎？嘖，沒想到這就遇到正主了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別廢話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任務失敗了，趁現在，走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得他們兩個......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳、咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人......都撤退了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒......嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受傷了，別動，這樣很容易失血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經聯絡了支援，他們很快就到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事，可怎麼會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天這場宴會有多少人知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，這種有組織有規模的襲擊，不可能沒有預謀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我現在的身份是公開的，想要知道我的行蹤沒有那麼困難......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，還好你來得夠及時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥倫比亞俚語*，什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇......死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汽車炸彈，在卡拉奇路過的時候精準引爆，威力很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇和離他較近的三名護衛當場死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......根據現場的殘骸，甚至沒有送醫的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"襲擊我們的人與殺死卡拉奇部長的毫無疑問是同一批人，他們到底是什麼目的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼來了？這裡還有這麼多法庭的車——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......貝洛內把她請來了，你該早些告訴我的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜·德克薩斯，作為卡拉奇部長死亡現場的第一目擊者，同時也是犯罪嫌疑人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我要將你逮捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你若有任何反抗行為，將被視為藐視敘拉古法律，並受到相應的懲罰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克薩斯沒有反抗，她看懂了這位法官的眼神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位長官以及家族的成員們，卡拉奇部長對於沃爾西尼的重要性不言而喻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位所受到的襲擊會在卡拉奇案中合併調查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拉維妮婭以自己的名譽擔保，一定會盡全力找出兇手，絕不姑息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是認真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"一連串事情的發生，讓萊昂圖索感到了些許疲憊。\n而就在他產生這個念頭的瞬間，他同時感到了一陣天旋地轉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雨依然在下，沒有停止的跡象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]}]}
